Add this to launch file 

```bash
Node(
            package='amigo_ros2_pi',
            executable='camera_pan_service_server',
            name='camera_pan_service_server',
            output='screen'
        ),
        Node(
            package='amigo_ros2_pi',
            executable='camera_pan_service_client',
            name='camera_pan_service_client',
            output='screen'
        ),
